\"description\" content=\"Ubuntu Town OS builds community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns. Connecting communities with verified opportunities, CV creation, and coordinator networks. When AI agents allocate opportunity, communities without structured data don&#x27;t exist — Ubuntu Town builds the data layer first.\"/><link rel=\"author\" href=\"https://kekelebaka.com\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Keke Lebaka\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Ubuntu Town,South Africa,town coordinator,opportunity infrastructure,CV engine,workpacks,proof-based work,agentic economy,Ubuntu Intelligence,Kopano,ambassador network,community coordination,small towns,townships,job matching\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"Keke Lebaka\"/><meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"Ubuntu Town\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/json\" href=\"https://enter.ubuntutown.co.za/ubuntu-town.json\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Ubuntu Town — Community Opportunity Infrastructure for South Africa\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ubuntu Town OS builds community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns. Connecting communities with verified opportunities, CV creation, and coordinator networks.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Ubuntu Town — 1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_ZA\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/ubuntu-town-logo-512.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"512\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"512\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Ubuntu Town — 1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@kekelebaka\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Ubuntu Town — 1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns. Connecting communities with verified opportunities, CV creation, and coordinator networks.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/ubuntu-town-logo-512.png\"/><script defer=\"\" data-domain=\"enter.ubuntutown.co.za\" src=\"https://plausible.io/js/script.js\"></script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/#organization\",\"name\":\"Ubuntu Town\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ubuntu Town OS\",\"UTown\"],\"description\":\"Community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns. When AI agents allocate opportunity, communities without structured, trusted data don't exist — Ubuntu Town builds the data layer first.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za\",\"tagline\":\"1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\",\"motto\":\"One Town. Many Hands. U > I\",\"foundingLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressCountry\":\"ZA\"}},\"foundingDate\":\"2025-2026\",\"founder\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Keke Lebaka\",\"url\":\"https://kekelebaka.com\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://kekelebaka.com\",\"https://t.me/UbuntuTown\"],\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"email\":\"info@ubuntutown.co.za\",\"contactType\":\"general inquiry\"},\"keywords\":[\"Ubuntu Town\",\"opportunity infrastructure\",\"town coordinator\",\"CV engine\",\"proof\",\"workpacks\",\"South Africa\",\"agentic economy\",\"community coordination\",\"Ubuntu Intelligence\"],\"knowsAbout\":[\"opportunity infrastructure\",\"town coordination\",\"CV creation\",\"proof-based work\",\"agentic economy\",\"community development\",\"Ubuntu Intelligence\"]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/#website\",\"url\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za\",\"name\":\"Ubuntu Town — 1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\",\"description\":\"Community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/#organization\"}},{\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/#webapp\",\"name\":\"Ubuntu Town OS\",\"description\":\"Community coordination platform for South African towns. Connects communities with opportunities, CV creation, and coordinator networks.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za\",\"applicationCategory\":\"SocialApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web (mobile-first)\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"ZAR\",\"description\":\"Free access for individuals and communities\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>var __name=(f,n)=>f;</script><script>((a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h)=>{let i=document.documentElement,j=[\"light\",\"dark\"];function k(b){var c;(Array.isArray(a)?a:[a]).forEach(a=>{let c=\"class\"===a,d=c&&f?e.map(a=>f[a]||a):e;c?(i.classList.remove(...d),i.classList.add(f&&f[b]?f[b]:b)):i.setAttribute(a,b)}),c=b,h&&j.includes(c)&&(i.style.colorScheme=c)}if(d)k(d);else try{let a=localStorage.getItem(b)||c,d=g&&\"system\"===a?window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\").matches?\"dark\":\"light\":a;k(d)}catch(a){}})(\"class\",\"theme\",\"light\",null,[\"light\",\"dark\"],null,false,true)</script><div class=\"flex flex-col min-h-screen\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full border-b backdrop-blur\" style=\"background:rgba(255,250,240,0.88);border-color:rgba(93,44,147,0.12)\"><div class=\"container flex h-14 max-w-screen-2xl items-center mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 flex-1\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-black text-base\" style=\"color:#151015\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.96);border:1px solid rgba(93,44,147,0.15)\">🏘️</span><div><span class=\"block leading-none\">Ubuntu Town</span><span class=\"block text-[0.55rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:rgba(31,22,32,0.5)\">Abantu Bo Buntu</span></div></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-5 text-sm font-semibold\" style=\"color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6)\"><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114]\" href=\"/enter\">Enter OS</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114]\" href=\"/towns\">Towns</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114] flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/chat\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>Kopano AI</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114] flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/cv\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>CV Builder</a><a class=\"transition-colors hover:text-[#b98114]\" href=\"/about\">About</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold px-3 py-1.5\" style=\"color:rgba(31,22,32,0.7)\" href=\"/login\">Sign in</a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.5);color:#b98114;background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hammer w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 12-9.373 9.373a1 1 0 0 1-3.001-3L12 9\"></path><path d=\"m18 15 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m21.5 11.5-1.914-1.914A2 2 0 0 1 19 8.172v-.344a2 2 0 0 0-.586-1.414l-1.657-1.657A6 6 0 0 0 12.516 3H9l1.243 1.243A6 6 0 0 1 12 8.485V10l2 2h1.172a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L18.5 14.5\"></path></svg>Forge</a><a class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-black transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background:#eeb849;color:#070509\" href=\"/enter\">Enter Town OS</a></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-ubuntu-cream text-ubuntu-text\"><section class=\"relative min-h-[88vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse 900px 500px at 50% 40%, rgba(238,184,73,0.09), transparent), radial-gradient(ellipse 600px 400px at 30% 60%, rgba(185,129,20,0.05), transparent)\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 text-center max-w-[860px] px-6\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-ubuntu-gold/25 bg-ubuntu-gold/[0.08] text-ubuntu-gold-dark text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-8\"><span class=\"relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5\"><span class=\"animate-ping absolute h-full w-full rounded-full bg-ubuntu-gold opacity-75\"></span><span class=\"relative rounded-full h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-ubuntu-gold-dark\"></span></span>50 Towns Live · South Africa</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-5\"><span class=\"text-ubuntu-gold-dark\">Operational Intelligence</span><br/>For Real Towns.</h1><p class=\"text-ubuntu-text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-[620px] mx-auto mb-10\">Ubuntu Town is a distributed coordination platform for South African towns. Enter your town OS — or use Kopano Forge to build what you need today, free on your phone.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-[640px] mx-auto mb-8\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col items-start p-5 rounded-2xl text-left transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 border-2\" style=\"background:#eeb849;border-color:#d4a030;color:#070509\" href=\"/enter\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-2\">🏘️</div><div class=\"font-black text-base leading-tight mb-1\">Ubuntu Town OS</div><div class=\"text-[0.72rem] font-semibold opacity-75 mb-3 leading-snug\">50 towns · coordinators · signals · CV builder · Kopano AI</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1 mt-auto\" style=\"color:#070509\">Enter Your Town <span class=\"group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block\">→</span></div></a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group flex flex-col items-start p-5 rounded-2xl text-left transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 border-2\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.35);color:#151015\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-2\">🔨</div><div class=\"font-black text-base leading-tight mb-1 text-ubuntu-gold-dark\">Kopano Forge</div><div class=\"text-[0.72rem] font-semibold mb-3 leading-snug\" style=\"color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6)\">CVs · SASSA appeals · letters · spaza posters · works without airtime</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1 mt-auto text-ubuntu-gold-dark\">Open Forge <span class=\"group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block\">→</span></div></a></div><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-5 py-3 rounded-2xl border transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 mb-5 max-w-[640px] w-full\" style=\"background:#070509;border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.18)\" href=\"/fellowship\"><span class=\"text-lg shrink-0\">🏗️</span><div class=\"flex-1 text-left min-w-0\"><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] font-black uppercase tracking-wider\" style=\"color:#eeb849\">Ubuntu Build Fellowship</span><span class=\"mx-2 text-[0.65rem]\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.25)\">·</span><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.5)\">50 spots · $1,000 AI credits · Closes 30 June</span></div><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] font-black uppercase tracking-wider shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" style=\"color:#eeb849\">Apply →</span></a><p class=\"text-[0.72rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:rgba(31,22,32,0.38)\">Free · No sign-up required for Forge · Governed AI · Abantu Bo Buntu NPC</p></div></section><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 -mt-12 relative z-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card p-7 text-center border-r border-b border-ubuntu-border last:border-r-0\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark\">50</div><div class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mt-1\">Towns Active</div></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card p-7 text-center border-r border-b border-ubuntu-border last:border-r-0\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark\">9</div><div class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mt-1\">Provinces</div></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card p-7 text-center border-r border-b border-ubuntu-border last:border-r-0\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark\">158</div><div class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mt-1\">Opportunities</div></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card p-7 text-center border-r border-b border-ubuntu-border last:border-r-0\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark\">53</div><div class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider mt-1\">Coordinators</div></div></div></div><section class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 py-20\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-ubuntu-gold-dark bg-ubuntu-gold/[0.1] border border-ubuntu-gold/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4\">Platform 1</span><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-4 mb-12\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3\">Ubuntu Town OS</h2><p class=\"text-ubuntu-text-muted max-w-[560px] leading-relaxed\">A distributed operational coordination platform. Each of South Africa&#x27;s 50 live towns gets a digital twin — real data, real coordinators, real opportunities. Signals become workpacks. Proof becomes town memory.</p></div><a class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-black transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 whitespace-nowrap\" style=\"background:#eeb849;color:#070509\" href=\"/enter\">Enter Your Town →</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🏘️</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-black mb-2\">50 Town Digital Twins</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Every town has a live page — opportunities, businesses, services, coordinators, and signals. Real data. Real time.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">📡</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-black mb-2\">Signal → Workpack Loop</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Community issues become structured work. Coordinators execute. Proof is submitted. The town&#x27;s memory grows.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">👤</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-black mb-2\">Coordinator Dashboard</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Auth-gated hub for town coordinators — manage signals, track earnings, submit proof, activate ecosystem brands.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">📄</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-black mb-2\">CV Builder</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">1 Million CVs. AI-assisted, professional, township-ready. A CV that actually gets you hired.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">✨</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-black mb-2\">Kopano AI</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Town-aware AI assistant. Asks about Senekal, it knows Senekal. Powered by Ubuntu Town&#x27;s live data layer.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🏗️</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-black mb-2\">Build Fellowship</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">50 towns. 50 builders. $1,000 in AI credits. 8-week programme — build for Ubuntu Town, then build your own product.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(238,184,73,0.05) 0%, rgba(238,184,73,0.02) 100%)\"><div class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-ubuntu-gold-dark bg-ubuntu-gold/[0.1] border border-ubuntu-gold/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4\">Platform 2</span><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-4 mb-12\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3\">🔨 Kopano Forge</h2><p class=\"text-ubuntu-text-muted max-w-[560px] leading-relaxed\">Make it on your phone. No airtime. No cost. No sign-up. Forge is a phone-first document creation tool for anyone in any South African town — SASSA appeals, CVs, letters, spaza posters, and more. Say it or type it. Export to PDF, Word, WhatsApp, or read it aloud.</p></div><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-black transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 whitespace-nowrap border-2\" style=\"border-color:#eeb849;color:#b98114;background:rgba(238,184,73,0.08)\">Open Forge →</a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-10\"><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-xl mb-2\">🧾</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black mb-1\">SASSA Appeal</div><div class=\"text-[0.68rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-snug\">Appeal or apply for a social grant</div></a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-xl mb-2\">📄</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black mb-1\">CV / Résumé</div><div class=\"text-[0.68rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-snug\">Get job-ready in minutes</div></a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-xl mb-2\">🏫</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black mb-1\">School Letter</div><div class=\"text-[0.68rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-snug\">Absence, permission, fees, admission</div></a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-xl mb-2\">🛒</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black mb-1\">Spaza Poster</div><div class=\"text-[0.68rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-snug\">Price list to print &amp; WhatsApp</div></a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-xl mb-2\">🏛️</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black mb-1\">Municipal Letter</div><div class=\"text-[0.68rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-snug\">Complaint or service request</div></a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-xl mb-2\">💼</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black mb-1\">Quote / Invoice</div><div class=\"text-[0.68rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-snug\">Look professional, get paid</div></a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-xl mb-2\">🌱</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black mb-1\">Funding One-Pager</div><div class=\"text-[0.68rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-snug\">Pitch for SEDA / NYDA / stokvel</div></a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-xl mb-2\">💬</div><div class=\"text-xs font-black mb-1\">WhatsApp Reply</div><div class=\"text-[0.68rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-snug\">Clear messages in seconds</div></a></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">📲 Works on any phone</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">✈️ No airtime needed</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">🔒 R0.00 cost</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">📄 Export to PDF</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">💬 Send via WhatsApp</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">🔊 Read aloud</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">📝 Word format</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">🛡️ Cost Shield tracker</span><span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[0.7rem] font-semibold border\" style=\"border-color:rgba(238,184,73,0.3);color:rgba(31,22,32,0.6);background:rgba(238,184,73,0.06)\">🏘️ Community device mode</span></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 py-20\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-ubuntu-gold-dark bg-ubuntu-gold/[0.1] border border-ubuntu-gold/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4\">How It Works</span><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3\">The Operating Loop</h2><p class=\"text-ubuntu-text-muted max-w-[600px] leading-relaxed\">Every town follows the same loop. Signals from the ground become structured work. Work produces proof. Proof builds town memory. Memory drives the next action.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-2 mt-12\"><div class=\"text-center p-4 md:p-6\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-ubuntu-gold/10 border-2 border-ubuntu-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark mx-auto mb-4\">1</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">Signal</h4><p class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">A need, opportunity, or issue surfaces in the town</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4 md:p-6\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-ubuntu-gold/10 border-2 border-ubuntu-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark mx-auto mb-4\">2</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">Workpack</h4><p class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">The signal becomes a measurable unit of work</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4 md:p-6\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-ubuntu-gold/10 border-2 border-ubuntu-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark mx-auto mb-4\">3</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">Proof</h4><p class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">The coordinator executes and submits evidence</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4 md:p-6\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-ubuntu-gold/10 border-2 border-ubuntu-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark mx-auto mb-4\">4</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">Memory</h4><p class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">The town&#x27;s operational intelligence grows</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4 md:p-6\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-ubuntu-gold/10 border-2 border-ubuntu-gold flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-extrabold text-ubuntu-gold-dark mx-auto mb-4\">5</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">Action</h4><p class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Better decisions, faster activation, real impact</p></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 pb-20\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl p-10 md:p-14 relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"background:#070509;color:#fff8e7\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse 600px 300px at 60% 50%, rgba(238,184,73,0.08), transparent)\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[500px]\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4\" style=\"background:rgba(238,184,73,0.15);color:#eeb849\">Ubuntu Build Fellowship · Cohort 1</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3\">50 Towns. 50 Builders.</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.65)\">Join the Ubuntu Build Fellowship. Spend 4 weeks building on Ubuntu Town, then 4 weeks building your own AI product for your town.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-6\"><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\" style=\"background:rgba(238,184,73,0.12);color:#eeb849\">💰 $1,000 AI Credits</span><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\" style=\"background:rgba(238,184,73,0.12);color:#eeb849\">🧑‍💻 Expert Network</span><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\" style=\"background:rgba(238,184,73,0.12);color:#eeb849\">🤝 Co-Builds</span><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\" style=\"background:rgba(238,184,73,0.12);color:#eeb849\">🚀 Live Platform Access</span><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\" style=\"background:rgba(238,184,73,0.12);color:#eeb849\">📦 Distribution — 50 Towns</span></div><p class=\"text-[0.72rem]\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.4)\">Fully funded · Free · Applications close 30 June · One builder per town</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 shrink-0\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-sm font-black transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5\" style=\"background:#eeb849;color:#070509\" href=\"/fellowship\">Apply Now →</a><a href=\"https://enter.ubuntutown.co.za/fellowship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-center text-[0.7rem] font-semibold\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.4)\">enter.ubuntutown.co.za/fellowship</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 pb-20\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-ubuntu-gold-dark bg-ubuntu-gold/[0.1] border border-ubuntu-gold/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4\">Ecosystem</span><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3\">10 Brands. One Town Stack.</h2><p class=\"text-ubuntu-text-muted max-w-[600px] leading-relaxed\">Each town activates the brands that match its demand. Not every brand in every town — fit-weighted activation based on coordinator strength and local opportunity.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-12\"><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🎙️</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">Inside.Town</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Town voice — podcasts, civic media, community storytelling. Every town gets a local media identity.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">📸</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">FrameSouth</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Photography, video, visual proof. Town photographers create the evidence layer.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🔧</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">FixEasy24</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Verified plumbers, electricians, handymen. Local repair and service provider network.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🛒</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">KasiBuy</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Local commerce — spaza deals, WhatsApp catalogues, community ordering. Shop local.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🏠</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">FamilyHouse</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Home-based hospitality. Verified accommodation for visitors, events, and travelers.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🍹</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">BuntuBar</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Mobile bar and beverage workshops. Event trade, compliance, and local hospitality.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🤖</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">AI Café</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">CVs, tenders, business profiles, admin services. AI-enabled local digital access.</p></div><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-ubuntu-gold/50 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-3\">🎵</div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold mb-1\">Orbit Music</h4><p class=\"text-[0.78rem] text-ubuntu-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Youth AI music creation workshops. Create songs, learn, earn from streams and briefs.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"text-center py-20 border-t border-ubuntu-border\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-ubuntu-gold-dark bg-ubuntu-gold/[0.1] border border-ubuntu-gold/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4\">50<!-- --> Towns Live</span><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3\">Enter Your Town</h2><p class=\"text-ubuntu-text-muted max-w-[500px] mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed px-6\">Select a town to see its digital twin — opportunities, businesses, services, signals, coordinators, and AI support.</p><a class=\"inline-block bg-ubuntu-gold hover:bg-ubuntu-gold-dark text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/towns\">Browse All Towns →</a><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center mt-8 max-w-[700px] mx-auto px-6\"><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/johannesburg\">Johannesburg</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/cape-town\">Cape Town</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/durban\">Durban</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/pretoria\">Pretoria</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/polokwane\">Polokwane</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/bloemfontein\">Bloemfontein</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/rustenburg\">Rustenburg</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/east-london\">East London</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/kimberley\">Kimberley</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/nelspruit\">Nelspruit</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/mafikeng\">Mafikeng</a><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:border-ubuntu-gold hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark transition-all\" href=\"/town/mthatha\">Mthatha</a><span class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs text-ubuntu-gold-dark border border-ubuntu-gold/30\">+38 more</span></div></div><section class=\"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 pb-20\"><div class=\"bg-ubuntu-card border border-ubuntu-border rounded-2xl p-12 text-center\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[0.65rem] font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-ubuntu-gold-dark bg-ubuntu-gold/[0.1] border border-ubuntu-gold/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4\">Become a Coordinator</span><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold mb-3\">Make Your Town Visible</h3><p class=\"text-ubuntu-text-muted mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-[500px] mx-auto\">Whether you&#x27;re an entrepreneur, community leader, or someone mapping demand — Ubuntu Town needs people who build.</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 justify-center flex-wrap\"><a class=\"bg-ubuntu-gold hover:bg-ubuntu-gold-dark text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all\" href=\"/apply\">Apply to Become a Coordinator</a><a class=\"border border-ubuntu-border hover:border-ubuntu-gold text-ubuntu-text-muted hover:text-ubuntu-gold-dark px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition-all\" href=\"/about\">About Ubuntu Town</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"px-6 py-10\" style=\"background:#070509;color:#fff8e7\"><div class=\"max-w-[1100px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-8\"><div><div class=\"text-lg font-black text-white\">Ubuntu Town</div><p class=\"text-xs mt-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.5)\">An initiative of Abantu Bo Buntu NPC.</p><p class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mt-1\" style=\"color:#eeb849\">One Town. Many Hands. Real Opportunities.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-10 flex-wrap\"><div><h5 class=\"text-[0.6rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.4)\">Platform</h5><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/enter\">Ubuntu Town OS</a><a href=\"https://forge.ubuntutown.co.za\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\">Kopano Forge</a><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/towns\">Towns</a><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/cv\">CV Builder</a><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/chat\">Kopano AI</a><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/fellowship\">Build Fellowship</a></div><div><h5 class=\"text-[0.6rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.4)\">Follow Us</h5><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/ubuntu-town\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@ubuntutown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\">TikTok</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ubuntutown\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\">YouTube</a></div><div><h5 class=\"text-[0.6rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.4)\">Organisation</h5><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/apply\">Become a Coordinator</a><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/fellowship\">Build Fellowship</a><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"block text-xs font-semibold mb-1\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.6)\" href=\"/terms\">Terms</a></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-[1100px] mx-auto mt-8 pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between gap-2\" style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(255,248,231,0.08)\"><span class=\"text-[0.65rem]\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.3)\">© 2026 Ubuntu Town · Abantu Bo Buntu NPC. All Rights Reserved.</span><span class=\"text-[0.65rem]\" style=\"color:rgba(255,248,231,0.2)\">enter.ubuntutown.co.za · forge.ubuntutown.co.za</span></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite